  "statement": {
    "case_for": "B002 remains my preferred achievement because it combines a discrete biological and vaccine principle with exceptionally mature clinical and population-health consequences: prevention of HPV infection and related cancers. The supplied record supports a coherent three-person attribution spanning the foundational virus-like-particle vaccine work, while the preventive effect is durable and unusually direct.",
    "case_against": "Its discovery-to-implementation history necessarily includes substantial wider scientific, clinical, industrial, and public-health contributions. The supplied evidence does not resolve the relative roles of the three proposed laureates in antigen design, translation, and implementation, so the attribution should be scrutinized carefully.",
